        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Watercolor; Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life\n- People: Kunihiko Yuyama\n- Places: Japan; Australia; United States; United Kingdom; Spain; Latin America\n- Organizations: Cartoon Network; Disney XD UK; Disney XD\n- Topics: film releases; English-language dub; Spanish-language dub\n\nFacts:\n- Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life is a 2009 Japanese anime film directed by Kunihiko Yuyama.\n- The Watercolor went on nationwide general release on November 13, 2009.\n- The English-language dub of Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life aired in Australia on November 6, 2009.\n- The English-language dub of Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life was released in the United States in theaters and on Cartoon Network on November 20, 2009.\n- The Spanish-language dub of Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life aired in Spain on Disney XD on April 4, 2010.\n- The English-language dub of Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life aired in the United Kingdom on Disney XD UK on May 28, 2010.\n- The Spanish-language dub of Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life aired in Latin America on Cartoon Network on November 21, 2010.",
